{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/ab7c6b460857a888fff2c2eb2cd817b4.avif?t=1762751053\" width=1536 height=383 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elven Queen has declared desire to be the highest form of existence. Commanding castes of elven women, she conquers the world through the arcane art of arousal. Every soul she subjugates fuels a ritual that brings her ever closer to transcendence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/02d1695b652bbea2d71fe71f644d4a0b.poster.avif?t=1762751053\" width=959 height=539 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/02d1695b652bbea2d71fe71f644d4a0b.webm?t=1762751053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Drow lead brutal raids.<br>\ud83c\udf32 Forest elves hunt the survivors.<br>\ud83e\udde0 High elves oversee the occult structure of domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All serve a singular purpose \u2014 the grand ritual of sexual enslavement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/1953194dffa841c80bbc0d5753de6b27.poster.avif?t=1762751053\" width=958 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/1953194dffa841c80bbc0d5753de6b27.webm?t=1762751053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Brom \u2014 a dwarf, once a garrison soldier. After the war, he stayed behind as a blacksmith and brewer in a quiet village. The fortress fell. The village burned. He survived \u2014 not because he was a hero, but because he was left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/e117a435eb3a99e97bace6772d89511d.poster.avif?t=1762751053\" width=955 height=537 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/e117a435eb3a99e97bace6772d89511d.webm?t=1762751053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, vengeance is all he has. And perhaps\u2026 a chance to save what little remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/d735aa89ca02b4fd55d5ead43fa7bee3.poster.avif?t=1762751053\" width=956 height=539 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828900/extras/d735aa89ca02b4fd55d5ead43fa7bee3.webm?t=1762751053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is adult, fantasy RPG, visual novel with rhythm-based combat, resource gathering, character progression, and crafting. Between battles, you\u2019ll manage your equipment, brew potions, talk to NPCs, and explore the world map. The game includes Live2D animations, an unlockable adult content with hot elves.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828900/b4f2981ebb72877f68bd1af8399b90f660ea3156.jpg"},{"name":"Deep hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828900/cf58ce2d3d3745a5231258dc6f3af2e66031f082.jpg"},{"name":"I hate magic","path":"https://cdn